{
  "lang": "zh",
  "film": "黑冰",
  "source_rel": "王志文《黑冰》经典对白，巅峰造极的台词功底和演技！/王志文《黑冰》经典对白，巅峰造极的台词功底和演技！.mp4",
  "t_start_global": 281.6,
  "t_end_global": 920.82,
  "duration": 639.22,
  "clip": "黑冰.mp4",
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.58,
      "text": "这上面有我在境外银行的数字账号,",
      "filename": "segment001.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 4.8,
      "end": 6.56,
      "text": "总共是三千万美元,",
      "filename": "segment002.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 9.08,
      "end": 13.54,
      "text": "还有那些你们感兴趣的所谓大人物的名单,",
      "filename": "segment003.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 15.36,
      "end": 16.38,
      "text": "不要饶了他们,",
      "filename": "segment004.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 18.18,
      "end": 20.78,
      "text": "该杀的杀,该抓的抓,",
      "filename": "segment005.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 24.04,
      "end": 24.58,
      "text": "请收好。",
      "filename": "segment006.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 42.68,
      "end": 44.12,
      "text": "你怎么不看一眼?",
      "filename": "segment007.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 53.7,
      "end": 55.48,
      "text": "你穿着这身新警服,",
      "filename": "segment008.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 57.88,
      "end": 58.82,
      "text": "真好看,",
      "filename": "segment009.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 70.48,
      "end": 72.32,
      "text": "让我猜猜你在想什么?",
      "filename": "segment010.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 76.36,
      "end": 77.54,
      "text": "你一定是在想,",
      "filename": "segment011.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 78.9,
      "end": 82.08,
      "text": "不是说所有的账号都输到商务通里了吗?",
      "filename": "segment012.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 85.01,
      "end": 85.71,
      "text": "不错,",
      "filename": "segment013.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 87.92,
      "end": 89.3,
      "text": "我骗了你,",
      "filename": "segment014.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 92.16,
      "end": 94.98,
      "text": "我经常会采取一些欺骗人的手段,",
      "filename": "segment015.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 96.28,
      "end": 98.4,
      "text": "因为太多的人骗了我,",
      "filename": "segment016.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 101.04,
      "end": 102.32,
      "text": "记得我小时候,",
      "filename": "segment017.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 103.34,
      "end": 105.4,
      "text": "只要犯了什么错误,",
      "filename": "segment018.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 105.84,
      "end": 109.12,
      "text": "我的继父惩罚我的方式不是打我骂我,",
      "filename": "segment019.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 111.22,
      "end": 112.72,
      "text": "他是罚我挨饿,",
      "filename": "segment020.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 114.6,
      "end": 117.34,
      "text": "一罚就是好几天不给吃的,",
      "filename": "segment021.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 119.14,
      "end": 122.48,
      "text": "所以我平时会攒下一些食物,",
      "filename": "segment022.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 122.68,
      "end": 124.74,
      "text": "藏在一个只有我自己知道的地方,",
      "filename": "segment023.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 126.36,
      "end": 127.44,
      "text": "这叫备战备荒,",
      "filename": "segment024.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 129.58,
      "end": 131.3,
      "text": "不可以相信别人的,",
      "filename": "segment025.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 132.68,
      "end": 133.92,
      "text": "只能相信自己,",
      "filename": "segment026.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 137.49,
      "end": 139.61,
      "text": "这也是我能侥幸活到今天的秘诀,",
      "filename": "segment027.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 141.59,
      "end": 143.29,
      "text": "其实你也一直在骗我,",
      "filename": "segment028.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 144.19,
      "end": 144.55,
      "text": "对不对?",
      "filename": "segment029.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 147.39,
      "end": 149.33,
      "text": "但是你是一个有良知的人,",
      "filename": "segment030.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 151.25,
      "end": 152.41,
      "text": "所以我能断定,",
      "filename": "segment031.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 153.39,
      "end": 154.85,
      "text": "今天晚上你会来,",
      "filename": "segment032.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 158.34,
      "end": 159.08,
      "text": "谢谢你,",
      "filename": "segment033.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 162.8,
      "end": 165.74,
      "text": "我谢谢你帮我实现了人生的最后一个愿望,",
      "filename": "segment034.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 180.17,
      "end": 181.45,
      "text": "你说这人是什么?",
      "filename": "segment035.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 185.15,
      "end": 186.59,
      "text": "从生物学的角度来说,",
      "filename": "segment036.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 186.71,
      "end": 189.47,
      "text": "人就是直立行走无毛动物而已,",
      "filename": "segment037.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 191.07,
      "end": 192.17,
      "text": "但是在我看来,",
      "filename": "segment038.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 194.8,
      "end": 197.42,
      "text": "人就像一封不知道从哪发出,",
      "filename": "segment039.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 198.8,
      "end": 201.6,
      "text": "又不知道发往何方的电子邮件,",
      "filename": "segment040.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 204.64,
      "end": 206.36,
      "text": "就是这些电子邮件,",
      "filename": "segment041.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 207.82,
      "end": 209.86,
      "text": "组成了一个复杂的人类世界,",
      "filename": "segment042.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 211.32,
      "end": 213.24,
      "text": "这是一个多么可怕的世界,",
      "filename": "segment043.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 215.54,
      "end": 217.6,
      "text": "他们把人分成三六九等,",
      "filename": "segment044.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 219.32,
      "end": 220.18,
      "text": "最高层的人,",
      "filename": "segment045.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 221.26,
      "end": 223.88,
      "text": "能够充分享受物质和精神的供应,",
      "filename": "segment046.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 225.62,
      "end": 227.16,
      "text": "然后随着层次的递减,",
      "filename": "segment047.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 229.18,
      "end": 231.18,
      "text": "供应就开始减少了,",
      "filename": "segment048.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 233.059,
      "end": 236.059,
      "text": "最低层次的人通常他们接收的物质能量,",
      "filename": "segment049.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 236.48,
      "end": 238.3,
      "text": "只能勉强维持他们的生活,",
      "filename": "segment050.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 239.68,
      "end": 242.7,
      "text": "而精神供应几乎是零,",
      "filename": "segment051.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 246.15,
      "end": 248.49,
      "text": "本人曾经就活在这个层面里,",
      "filename": "segment052.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 252.05,
      "end": 254.79,
      "text": "你可以有充分的理由不相信我说的话,",
      "filename": "segment053.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 256.29,
      "end": 259.85,
      "text": "你会想我有一个才华出众的父亲,",
      "filename": "segment054.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 259.85,
      "end": 261.37,
      "text": "他是一个作家,",
      "filename": "segment055.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 262.11,
      "end": 265.49,
      "text": "我可以在他那里继承他的智慧良知,",
      "filename": "segment056.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 267.39,
      "end": 271.07,
      "text": "我还有一个曾经是乐曲名单的母亲,",
      "filename": "segment057.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 272.85,
      "end": 276.45,
      "text": "我可以继承他的艺术天赋和不俗的容貌,",
      "filename": "segment058.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 279.05,
      "end": 283.85,
      "text": "我还有一个出生在资产阶级家庭的高级干部的继父,",
      "filename": "segment059.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 284.53,
      "end": 289.83,
      "text": "从他那里我可以继承他的政治野心和是他成功的机会,",
      "filename": "segment060.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 292.29,
      "end": 295.05,
      "text": "我怎么可能生活在最底层呢?",
      "filename": "segment061.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 295.41,
      "end": 298.65,
      "text": "我应该是这个社会当中的精神贵族,",
      "filename": "segment062.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 303.92,
      "end": 308.18,
      "text": "但是我生活的另一面你看不到,",
      "filename": "segment063.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 313.16,
      "end": 314.66,
      "text": "永远也看不到的,",
      "filename": "segment064.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 316.02,
      "end": 318.16,
      "text": "我可以一顿吃下三斤牛肉,",
      "filename": "segment065.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 319.12,
      "end": 322.74,
      "text": "然后再吃半只烤鸭和一碗北京地道的炸酱面,",
      "filename": "segment066.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 323.84,
      "end": 325.86,
      "text": "我还可以三天三夜的不睡觉,",
      "filename": "segment067.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 326.32,
      "end": 328.92,
      "text": "然后在雪地上像疯子一样的狂跑,",
      "filename": "segment068.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 330.54,
      "end": 334.46,
      "text": "所以有时候我觉得我的前身可能是只骆驼,",
      "filename": "segment069.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 336.12,
      "end": 337.34,
      "text": "没有这点能耐,",
      "filename": "segment070.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 337.78,
      "end": 340.8,
      "text": "当年我怀揣十个美元从旧金山下飞机,",
      "filename": "segment071.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 341.7,
      "end": 343.32,
      "text": "恐怕连一天都活不下去,",
      "filename": "segment072.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 347.36,
      "end": 349.42,
      "text": "后来我不再为钱发愁了,",
      "filename": "segment073.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 350.5,
      "end": 353.82,
      "text": "但是这个时候我比任何时候都要仇恨钱,",
      "filename": "segment074.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 354.62,
      "end": 355.7,
      "text": "仇恨人类,",
      "filename": "segment075.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 357.7,
      "end": 359.08,
      "text": "仇恨这个肮脏的世界,",
      "filename": "segment076.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 370.19,
      "end": 374.73,
      "text": "你们习惯把人群分成罪犯和非罪犯,",
      "filename": "segment077.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": 374.89,
      "end": 376.69,
      "text": "就是所谓的好人和坏人,",
      "filename": "segment078.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": 377.37,
      "end": 382.01,
      "text": "并且由此延伸出一些高尚卑鄙之类的概念,",
      "filename": "segment079.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": 383.91,
      "end": 385.81,
      "text": "但是我要告诉你,",
      "filename": "segment080.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": 387.01,
      "end": 389.19,
      "text": "其实一切都是机会而已,",
      "filename": "segment081.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": 391.05,
      "end": 393.09,
      "text": "穷乡僻壤的犯罪率低,",
      "filename": "segment082.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": 393.99,
      "end": 395.93,
      "text": "不意味着那儿的人就高尚,",
      "filename": "segment083.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": 396.73,
      "end": 398.43,
      "text": "因为他们没有选择,",
      "filename": "segment084.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": 400.73,
      "end": 404.97,
      "text": "没有选择就不会有痛苦,",
      "filename": "segment085.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": 407.99,
      "end": 409.79,
      "text": "我母亲当年改嫁到林家,",
      "filename": "segment086.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": 410.65,
      "end": 411.63,
      "text": "别的不说,",
      "filename": "segment087.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": 412.19,
      "end": 415.53,
      "text": "就说林小强对她无微不至的骚扰,",
      "filename": "segment088.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": 417.27,
      "end": 419.71,
      "text": "就不是一般人能够承受的,",
      "filename": "segment089.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": 422.59,
      "end": 426.61,
      "text": "但是母亲好像并不痛苦,",
      "filename": "segment090.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": 428.33,
      "end": 429.67,
      "text": "因为她有我,",
      "filename": "segment091.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": 432.25,
      "end": 433.51,
      "text": "还有弟弟小亮,",
      "filename": "segment092.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": 436.41,
      "end": 439.19,
      "text": "母亲甚至没有权利来选择她死亡,",
      "filename": "segment093.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": 443.09,
      "end": 446.09,
      "text": "而林家大起大落的政治命运,",
      "filename": "segment094.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": 446.91,
      "end": 450.47,
      "text": "又使我的灵魂加速地走向堕落,",
      "filename": "segment095.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": 452.91,
      "end": 454.63,
      "text": "我切肤之痛地感受到,",
      "filename": "segment096.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": 456.05,
      "end": 457.99,
      "text": "我的命运之所以悲惨,",
      "filename": "segment097.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": 459.13,
      "end": 460.17,
      "text": "原因只有一个,",
      "filename": "segment098.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": 462.71,
      "end": 463.63,
      "text": "没权,",
      "filename": "segment099.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": 466.97,
      "end": 471.01,
      "text": "所以从那天我就奠定我自己的人生目标是什么,",
      "filename": "segment100.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": 473.27,
      "end": 477.19,
      "text": "我要不择手段的疯狂的去追逐钱和权,",
      "filename": "segment101.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": 477.81,
      "end": 482.31,
      "text": "然后用他们来报复这个可恶的人类社会,",
      "filename": "segment102.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": 488.96,
      "end": 490.76,
      "text": "你知道权力是什么吗?",
      "filename": "segment103.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": 492.16,
      "end": 497.88,
      "text": "权力绝不是说是一纸公文就能够让你荣辱升迁的某个职务,",
      "filename": "segment104.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": 499.2,
      "end": 502.58,
      "text": "权力也不是某种让你实现人生价值的行为快感,",
      "filename": "segment105.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": 503.66,
      "end": 504.86,
      "text": "权力的实质,",
      "filename": "segment106.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": 505.8,
      "end": 510.98,
      "text": "看你在多大程度上影响和控制他人乃至整个社会的精神生活,",
      "filename": "segment107.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": 512.6,
      "end": 517.98,
      "text": "要想能够真正完全彻底的控制人没有比毒品更好的东西了,",
      "filename": "segment108.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": 519.14,
      "end": 521.38,
      "text": "你见没见过能够真正摆脱毒品的人,",
      "filename": "segment109.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": 523.44,
      "end": 527.2,
      "text": "你可能会觉得你自己可以控制自己,",
      "filename": "segment110.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": 528.0,
      "end": 532.12,
      "text": "但是实际上你只能控制你的手不伸到别人的钱袋里,",
      "filename": "segment111.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": 532.12,
      "end": 534.42,
      "text": "你的脚不迈进监狱的大门,",
      "filename": "segment112.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start": 534.76,
      "end": 536.54,
      "text": "你的眼睛不去射人心魄,",
      "filename": "segment113.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start": 538.04,
      "end": 540.96,
      "text": "你根本控制不了你的肝脏分泌多少酶,",
      "filename": "segment114.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": 541.22,
      "end": 542.84,
      "text": "你的胰脏分泌多少胰岛素,",
      "filename": "segment115.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": 543.2,
      "end": 544.86,
      "text": "你更控制不了你的心跳,",
      "filename": "segment116.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start": 546.24,
      "end": 546.92,
      "text": "你的血压,",
      "filename": "segment117.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start": 548.16,
      "end": 549.28,
      "text": "你大脑里的潜意识,",
      "filename": "segment118.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start": 551.46,
      "end": 553.04,
      "text": "这些只有药品才能做到,",
      "filename": "segment119.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "start": 554.64,
      "end": 559.04,
      "text": "所以我用我毕生的精力在不断推出新产品,",
      "filename": "segment120.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "start": 563.04,
      "end": 565.26,
      "text": "可惜时间太短了,",
      "filename": "segment121.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "start": 576.36,
      "end": 579.18,
      "text": "在你们眼里我一定是个十恶不赦的死刑犯,",
      "filename": "segment122.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "start": 581.12,
      "end": 586.2,
      "text": "可是在我自己和那千万个不幸的灵魂的心目中,",
      "filename": "segment123.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "start": 588.28,
      "end": 589.58,
      "text": "我是一个英雄,",
      "filename": "segment124.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "start": 591.06,
      "end": 592.42,
      "text": "我是他们的救星,",
      "filename": "segment125.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "start": 594.86,
      "end": 595.54,
      "text": "福音,",
      "filename": "segment126.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "start": 599.67,
      "end": 600.11,
      "text": "爸,",
      "filename": "segment127.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "start": 600.11,
      "end": 600.29,
      "text": "妈,",
      "filename": "segment128.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "start": 606.18,
      "end": 607.52,
      "text": "你们的儿子来了,",
      "filename": "segment129.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "start": 609.72,
      "end": 611.78,
      "text": "你们的儿子披荆斩棘,",
      "filename": "segment130.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "start": 611.96,
      "end": 614.02,
      "text": "引航高歌地向你们走来了,",
      "filename": "segment131.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "start": 615.8,
      "end": 617.66,
      "text": "在长途汽车站等着我,",
      "filename": "segment132.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "start": 618.5,
      "end": 618.68,
      "text": "不,",
      "filename": "segment133.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "start": 620.14,
      "end": 621.0,
      "text": "火车站,",
      "filename": "segment134.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "start": 621.82,
      "end": 621.98,
      "text": "对,",
      "filename": "segment135.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "start": 623.02,
      "end": 623.76,
      "text": "火车站,",
      "filename": "segment136.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "start": 625.34,
      "end": 627.48,
      "text": "这是一辆通往梦境的列车,",
      "filename": "segment137.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "start": 629.94,
      "end": 631.46,
      "text": "我要站在高高的架子上,",
      "filename": "segment138.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "start": 632.62,
      "end": 635.04,
      "text": "让海风驱散漫天的乌云,",
      "filename": "segment139.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "start": 635.46,
      "end": 635.9,
      "text": "太阳,",
      "filename": "segment140.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "start": 636.1,
      "end": 637.08,
      "text": "你快出来吧,",
      "filename": "segment141.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "start": 637.36,
      "end": 639.22,
      "text": "露出你那金灿灿的笑脸,",
      "filename": "segment142.mp4"
    }
  ]
}